## Case: b07-recursive-fib
id: "ace.m1.b07"
module-name: "m1_b07"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

````auto
fn main() int {
    var total int = 0
    var i int = 0
    for i < 3 {
        var j int = 0
        loop {
            j = j + 1
            if j == 2 { continue }
            if j == 3 { break }
            total = total + 10
        }
        i = i + 1
    }
    return total
}
````

