## Case: b10-short-circuit-eval
id: "ace.m1.b10"
module-name: "m1_b10"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

````auto
fn even(n int) bool {
    if n == 0 { return true }
    return odd(n - 1)
}
fn odd(n int) bool {
    if n == 0 { return false }
    return even(n - 1)
}
fn main() int {
    if even(6) { return 42 }
    return 1
}
````

